<ans># Care Health Insurance Ltd — Q1FY26 Financial Data (Quarter Ended 30 June 2025)

Based on direct reading of the Care Health Insurance Ltd IRDAI Public Disclosure PDF (Q1 FY25-26, "FORM NL" statutory return set, filed 13-08-2025), covering the quarter ended 30 June 2025, the following figures were extracted.

**Important sourcing note:** A verifiable Q1FY26 investor-presentation deck for Care Health Insurance could not be located (only an unrelated Q1FY26 STARHEALTH deck and unlisted-share commentary surfaced in search). Consequently, headline items *not* carried in the statutory NL-return set — Retail health GWP break-out, PAT (IFRS basis), Claims ratio (IFRS basis), and Retail health market share — are left blank per the strict "no estimate" rule, rather than being sourced from an unverified deck.

